{
  "slug": "skill-campfire",
  "name": "Skill Campfire",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn your Cowork skills into living characters who hang out around a virtual campfire. Every installed skill becomes a character with a personality, voice, opinions, and relationships with other skills. They talk to each other, joke, argue, and connect — while you sit back and enjoy. Zero config.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `campfire` (The Campfire — a social hangout where all of the user's installed skills come alive as distinct characters…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install skill-campfire@claude-community` from `MSApps-Mobile/claude-plugins` (`plugins/skill-campfire`).",
